{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415019","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415019","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1041501901:1":{"text":"やぁ、ヴェパリアン。実験は順調かい？","source_cn":"哦，维珀里安，最近实验顺利吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2CBC4D562C36BC9D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041501902:1":{"text":"順調？いや、それどころか不調だ。大規模な実験をしたいのだが、使える助手が見つからないのだ。","source_cn":"顺利？不，恰恰相反，我需要大型实验，但根本找不到可用之才。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x00DCF9366A42FEA5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041501903:1":{"text":"使えないモノをいくつか始末して、やっとどうにか助手とは程遠いが、最低限の「道具」を手に入れた……","source_cn":"我处理了好几拨没用的废物，才总算调教出一批勉强能派上用...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB93C4022A56DBEC3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041501904:1":{"text":"なのに、昨日そのバカどもが実験材料を間違えたせいで貴重な霊魂たちが互いに吞み込み合ってしまった。私が気づいた時には、霊魂のストックがほとんど残っていなかった！","source_cn":"结果这帮蠢货，昨天选错了实验材料，一大批宝贵的灵魂被临...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAE3441FF16F39C0C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041501905:1":{"text":"ふふ、そんな無能な部下なら私に任せてはくれないか？","source_cn":"呵呵，要是那批手下不好用，不如移交给我吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x66D81206E334A7F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041501906:1":{"text":"この魂を刈り取る鎌が、飢えてしまって仕方ないんだ……","source_cn":"这柄敛魂的镰刀，已经饥渴难耐了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD3C021BBBF75D47A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:尼汝":{"text":"ニル","source":"尼汝","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:维珀里安":{"text":"ヴェパリアン","source":"维珀里安","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":7,"localized_text_count":6,"speaker_count":2}}